    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund an urgent referral pathway for vascular compressions",
        "additional_details": "This is incredibly important as so many people especially frail and young people get misdiagnosed with IBS and live in pain. We don\u2019t want more people to suffer.",
        "background": "Fund an urgent referral pathway for suspected vascular compressions like superior mesenteric artery syndrome (SMA) and median arcuate ligament syndrome (MALS). This would be similar to the urgent cancer pathway.",
